WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
A greeting, face to face

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:14.500
Clear daylight across five countries

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:24.500
Rain, snow, fog, thunder, light clouds

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:36.500
Sunset, then the moon drifts on

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:42.050
The moon fades into a quiet dawn

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:45.550
One more greeting before we go
